/ActualText (Product Growth & Impact\nWindows Share: Led design across apps, people and devices, driving 6.3x growth in share completions \(18M to 112.9M\). Higher share completion is linked to higher Windows daily usage, making sharing a driver of platform engagement\nDrop Tray: Led design and launch of a new Windows drag-and-drop surface, contributing to 22.5x growth in completion sessions \(0.22M to 4.9M\) within a year of phased global rollout.)
/K [11]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 987 0 R
/Pg 5 0 R
>>
